1
00:00:00,575 --> 00:00:01,675
(Sheldon:)And that makes sense.

2
00:00:01,843 --> 00:00:04,343
(Sheldon:)You'd think after Xbox,
there'd be Xbox 2.

3
00:00:04,513 --> 00:00:08,293
But no, next came Xbox 360. Hm?

4
00:00:08,416 --> 00:00:11,456
(Sheldon:)And now, after 360, comes Xbox One.

5
00:00:12,954 --> 00:00:13,954
Why "One"?

6
00:00:14,856 --> 00:00:17,306
(Sheldon:)Maybe that's how many seconds
of thought they put into naming it.

7
00:00:18,627 --> 00:00:19,937
(Amy:)Can you get the butter, please?

8
00:00:20,095 --> 00:00:22,665
(Sheldon:)You know, however,
with the Xbox One,

9
00:00:22,831 --> 00:00:25,111
(Sheldon:)I can control
my entire entertainment system

10
00:00:25,267 --> 00:00:26,677
(Sheldon:)using voice commands.

11
00:00:26,835 --> 00:00:28,835
(Sheldon:)Up until now,
I've had to use Leonard.

12
00:00:30,639 --> 00:00:32,639
(Amy:)Then get the other one.
Pass the butter.

13
00:00:33,208 --> 00:00:34,778
(Sheldon:)Hang on.

14
00:00:34,943 --> 00:00:37,483
(Sheldon:)I don't feel like you're taking
this dilemma seriously.

15
00:00:38,880 --> 00:00:40,290
(Amy:)Fine, Sheldon.

16
00:00:40,682 --> 00:00:42,182
(Amy:)You have my undivided attention.

17
00:00:42,450 --> 00:00:46,900
(Sheldon:)Okay, now, the PS4 is
more angular and sleek-looking.

18
00:00:47,055 --> 00:00:49,005
-(MOCKING) No way.
-Yeah.

19
00:00:49,157 --> 00:00:52,067
(Sheldon:)It's true. But the larger size
of the Xbox One

20
00:00:52,227 --> 00:00:53,537
(Sheldon:)may keep it from overheating.

21
00:00:53,695 --> 00:00:55,975
(Amy:)You wouldn't want
your gaming system to overheat.

22
00:00:56,131 --> 00:00:58,011
(Sheldon:)Well, you absolutely would not.

23
00:00:58,166 --> 00:01:02,026
(Sheldon:)And furthermore, the Xbox One
now comes with a Kinect included.

